codex
The live sample caught a self-inflicted fixture regression: `Process.waitUntilExit()` can deadlock after the existing `isRunning` polling has already observed sshd termination. I’m removing that change; the useful fix is the deterministic channel protocol, not an unbounded Foundation process wait. The sample is retained as evidence, and I’m stopping only the test process I launched.
